---
const {
  image = "/images/Ai-Page/Human_First.svg",
  buttonLink = "/ai-integration",
} = Astro.props;
---

<section class="human-first">
  <div class="human-first__container">
    
    <!-- Top Row: Intersecting Borders -->
    <div class="header-block">
      <div class="header-left">
        <div class="title-top">
          <h2>Human-first</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="title-bottom">
          <h2 class="accent-text">Not AI-First</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="header-right">
        <p class="intro-text">
          A lot of AI-first companies start with the AI. Brainstorm with AI, architect with AI, build with AI, and check the output with a human at the end.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Row: Image and Content -->
    <div class="bottom-grid">
      <div class="bottom-image-wrapper">
        <img src={image} alt="Office workspace" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      
      <div class="bottom-content">
        <p>We work the other way. Our people lead the thinking. AI is a tool inside that process, not a replacement for it.</p>
        <p>That means the humans making decisions about your systems understand your business first, and reach for AI because it earns its place, not because it's trendy.</p>
        <p>Effective business AI integration. Not AI for its own sake.</p>
        
        <a href={buttonLink} class="learn-more-btn">
          <span class="text">LEARN MORE ABOUT AI INTEGRATION</span>
          <span class="icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M14 2.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5h-6a.5.5 0 0 0 0 1h4.793L2.146 13.146a.5.5 0 0 0 .708.708L13 3.707V8.5a.5.5 0 0 0 1 0v-6z"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .human-first {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #0d6b61; 
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 100px 0;
  }

  .human-first__container {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  /* --- Top Grid & Borders --- */
  .header-block {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; /* Forces exactly 50/50 split */
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); /* The long continuous bottom line */
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .header-left {
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); /* The center vertical line */
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  .title-top {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); /* The horizontal line that stops in the middle */
    padding: 0 30px 20px 0;
  }

  .title-bottom {
    padding: 20px 30px 20px 0;
    text-align: right; 
  }

  .header-left h2 {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .accent-text {
    color: #c6f147; 
  }

  .header-right {
    padding: 0 0 20px 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center; 
  }

  .intro-text {
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  /* --- Bottom Grid --- */
  .bottom-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .bottom-image-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    background: #d9d9d9; 
    min-height: 350px;
    display: flex;
  }

  .bottom-image-wrapper img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .bottom-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    padding-top: 10px;
  }

  .bottom-content p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  /* --- Button Styling --- */
  .learn-more-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    color: #1e293b;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    align-self: flex-start;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .learn-more-btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .learn-more-btn .text {
    padding: 12px 20px;
  }

  .learn-more-btn .icon {
    background-color: #c6f147; 
    color: #1e293b;
    padding: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  /* --- Responsive Adjustments --- */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .header-block {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .header-left {
      border-right: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    }
    .title-bottom {
      text-align: left; 
      padding-right: 0;
    }
    .header-right {
      padding: 30px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    }
    .bottom-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
